WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:06.464
Hey, Sarah?

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:16.766
Huh? What the hell is this?

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:29.612
I remember...

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:33.825
I am... a researcher here.

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:37.620
They caught me when I was
exposing their experiments...

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:39.873
Experiments? About what?

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:44.335
XM. Exotic Matter.

00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:46.421
It’s a quantum substance.

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:49.466
And they want to bend it to their will.

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:52.427
And that’s, uh... a bad thing?

00:00:53.094 --> 00:00:57.640
XM. It has the capability to
directly affect the human mind.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:02.020
In their hands,
it will be used to betray humanity.

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:04.522
We have to stop them!

00:01:04.647 --> 00:01:06.900
Stop them? Sarah!
Do you hear yourself?

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:11.488
Oh... Sorry.

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:14.157
The thing is...

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:20.538
It’s so crazy,
even I wouldn’t believe it.

00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:25.168
That’s what I felt in the vision...
She’s like me...

00:01:26.169 --> 00:01:29.672
And she’s lost in all of this too.

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:31.257
But...

00:01:34.135 --> 00:01:34.969
Makoto...

00:01:35.804 --> 00:01:37.889
I need you to believe.

00:01:38.515 --> 00:01:42.769
Because right now...
It’s us against the world.

00:01:53.196 --> 00:01:54.030
I believe you.

00:02:01.871 --> 00:02:03.373
Maybe we’re both crazy.

